%%% note
max-oms (マックス証券、架空): その日の注文をまとめて約定させ、約定を本物の Anypoint MQ (T1/Sandbox、試験用のキュー
max-test-fills) に送る。鍵の誤り、日付の誤り、終値の無い銘柄、2 件の注文 (並びと ID は max/fills.dwl)、同じ日の二度目
(注文は増えない)、送った約定をキューから受けて確かめる (/admin/peek-fills)、空の日。
DB は mulay の試験用の PG (localhost:15432、スキーマ max)。最初に /admin/reset で合成データを流し直し、キューも空にする。
%%% requires src/main/resources/mq-secret.yaml
%%% jvm -Dhttp.port=18478 -Dapi.key=test-key -Dadmin.reset=true -Dmq.fillsQueue=max-test-fills
%%% port 18478
%%% request GET /health
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "status": "ok"
}
%%% request POST /admin/reset
authorization: Bearer test-key
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "reset": true
}
%%% request POST /orders/day
content-type: application/json

{"date":"2026-10-12","orders":[],"closes":{}}
%%% response 401
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "error": "Missing or wrong API key"
}
%%% request POST /orders/day
authorization: Bearer test-key
content-type: application/json

{"date":"10/12","orders":[],"closes":{}}
%%% response 400
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "error": "date must be yyyy-MM-dd"
}
%%% request POST /orders/day
authorization: Bearer test-key
content-type: application/json

{"date":"2026-10-12","orders":[{"customer_id":"C001","code":"MX99","side":"買","qty":100}],"closes":{"MX01":1000.5}}
%%% response 400
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "error": "No close for MX99"
}
%%% request POST /orders/day
authorization: Bearer test-key
content-type: application/json

{"date":"2026-10-12","orders":[{"customer_id":"C015","code":"MX14","side":"買","qty":100,"channel":"対面"},{"customer_id":"C008","code":"MX15","side":"買","qty":1200}],"closes":{"MX14":1476.5,"MX15":1551.7}}
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "date": "2026-10-12",
  "fills": [
    {
      "tradeId": "T261012001",
      "orderId": "O26101200001"
    },
    {
      "tradeId": "T261012002",
      "orderId": "O26101200002"
    }
  ]
}
%%% request POST /orders/day
authorization: Bearer test-key
content-type: application/json

{"date":"2026-10-12","orders":[{"customer_id":"C015","code":"MX14","side":"買","qty":100,"channel":"対面"},{"customer_id":"C008","code":"MX15","side":"買","qty":1200}],"closes":{"MX14":1476.5,"MX15":1551.7}}
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "date": "2026-10-12",
  "fills": [
    {
      "tradeId": "T261012001",
      "orderId": "O26101200001"
    },
    {
      "tradeId": "T261012002",
      "orderId": "O26101200002"
    }
  ]
}
